{"id":1213700,"shortDescription":"Espíritu del norte es un juego de aventura en tercera persona para un solo jugador inspirado en los impresionantes y misteriosos paisajes de Islandia. Juega en el papel de un zorro rojo común cuya historia se entrelaza con el guardián de la aurora boreal, un zorro con espíritu femenino.","developers":["Infuse Studio"],"publishers":["Silver Lining Interactive"],"categories":["Un jugador","Logros de Steam","Compat. total con mando","Cromos de Steam","Jugable sin restricciones de tiempo","Sonido estéreo","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"7 MAY 2020","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1213700?t=1786487264","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213700/ss_0b4d8358c5605e7322cd5f3697bbbd2b909401c5.600x338.jpg?t=1786487264","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213700/ss_0b4d8358c5605e7322cd5f3697bbbd2b909401c5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786487264"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213700/ss_3b585c6f6771436a73fcfc72a9012fb83c20beb3.600x338.jpg?t=1786487264","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213700/ss_3b585c6f6771436a73fcfc72a9012fb83c20beb3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786487264"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213700/ss_5f049501bdaa03e7bfb173e4b4e5a7373cf6736d.600x338.jpg?t=1786487264","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213700/ss_5f049501bdaa03e7bfb173e4b4e5a7373cf6736d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786487264"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213700/ss_efb21ff1e9c997cb121b39744f1668c5c64d7ecf.600x338.jpg?t=1786487264","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213700/ss_efb21ff1e9c997cb121b39744f1668c5c64d7ecf.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786487264"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c